  WHAT CHANGED FROM THE AUGUST CHALLENGE VERSION
  Five nights in August became one night on September 1. Doors 8 to 9 PM ET
  for everyone, then 9 to 9:30 for campus members in the same room.

  Everything that was working stayed: the ticket layout, the trust strip,
  the proof wall, and the three-call Klaviyo registration recipe, which
  converted at 28.8% and is not touched below.

  The VIP ticket is still $9 and still opens the campus. It is the point of
  the night now, not a line at the end, and the nine o'clock split is where
  that decision gets made.

  HOW TO USE
  1. Themes > Edit code > Templates > page.lashmasterychallenge.liquid
  2. DELETE EVERYTHING in the file before pasting this in.
  3. Save.

